{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/8/7486bdd59c5b8daf7291ba82ecb723f6c81b4861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_3x)(\\log_x5)=\\log_35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"183\" height=\"18\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/2/95296d839b99b0746b9d21c2ba1df6f08e7738f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\text{ and } 5 \\text{ only} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3, 5, \\text{ and } 15 \\text{ only} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{only numbers of the form } 5^n \\cdot 3^m, \\text{ where } n \\text{ and } m \\text{ are positive integers} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{all positive } x \\neq 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"554\" height=\"57\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99464fc4a6d82a4e4d70c67595ae296813d236a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_3 x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"46\" height=\"19\" /> is defined if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/996fd8d801d6efc048fb341a70c9df5b9cad4d34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"46\" height=\"19\" /> is defined if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive but not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is positive and not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, by the change of base formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a9f00c48cb200955d292fb7ef1a92dea2811bf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_3 x)(\\log_x 5) = \\frac{\\log x}{\\log 3}\\cdot\\frac{\\log 5}{\\log x} = \\frac{\\log 5}{\\log 3} = \\log_3 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"369\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the set of all positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying the equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb839b526ac59e9f88638b35d4e17fbf89763206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{all positive } x \\neq 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"175\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\